WEBVTT

00:02.810 --> 00:07.710
Hey, I heard she already did it
with her boyfriend.

00:07.710 --> 00:09.780
Huh? Is that so...

00:09.780 --> 00:12.030
He looks so handsome.
That makes me jealous.

00:12.030 --> 00:13.300
I know, right?

00:13.300 --> 00:15.510
Nina, do you have someone
that you're interested in?

00:15.510 --> 00:15.930
Huh?

00:15.930 --> 00:18.160
What about Gino?

00:18.160 --> 00:18.920
Gino?

00:18.920 --> 00:21.270
And suddenly, he started to panic.

00:22.190 --> 00:25.420
- I have never seen his face like that before.
- Gino and I aren't in that kind of relationship!

00:25.800 --> 00:28.520
And I'm going to keep living
for the sword.

00:28.520 --> 00:31.540
As expected of the Mad Dog's rival.

00:31.540 --> 00:34.070
It seems Nina is not interested
in romance.

00:44.910 --> 00:47.100
That Mad Dog is still
the same as ever.

00:47.100 --> 00:49.540
Was she training with the Sword God?

00:53.010 --> 00:56.130
I'm sure you won't be
able to attract a man!

00:56.520 --> 00:59.880
I'm sure you'll be a virgin and live
with the sword until you die!

01:03.800 --> 01:06.010
Wh-What?

01:06.010 --> 01:10.520
Sorry, but I'm not a virgin anymore.

01:10.520 --> 01:11.690
Wha...

01:11.690 --> 01:14.180
You're lying, right?
Who was it?

01:14.180 --> 01:16.690
A guy I grew up with
since we were young.

01:16.690 --> 01:19.120
Rudeus is amazing, you know!

01:19.120 --> 01:22.620
We traveled from the Demon Continent to
our homeland together as adventurers.

01:22.620 --> 01:25.290
He was able to hit Orsted once!

01:25.290 --> 01:28.310
No way! I heard from my father that
his battle aura is so great.

01:28.310 --> 01:31.820
Half-baked attacks won't be
able to scratch him!

01:31.820 --> 01:35.750
I'm not lying, and Rudeus is
not a half-baked person.

01:37.740 --> 01:40.620
Rudeus and I aren't on
equal footing right now.

01:41.350 --> 01:43.880
I have to become stronger.

01:52.750 --> 01:57.220
I'm sure Rudeus is just Eris's delusion.

02:02.070 --> 02:03.240
Rudeus?

02:03.240 --> 02:07.200
Yes! There's no adventurer
with such a name, right?

02:08.370 --> 02:12.950
Well, if you mean Rudeus the Quagmire,
then he is a famous adventurer.

02:12.950 --> 02:13.620
Huh?

02:13.620 --> 02:17.190
That Stepped Leader
invited him many times.

02:17.190 --> 02:20.660
Apparently, he took down a stray red dragon
all by himself the other day.

02:20.660 --> 02:21.840
Amazing, right?

02:21.840 --> 02:23.470
A red dragon all by himself?!

02:23.470 --> 02:25.090
That's insane!

02:25.880 --> 02:29.200
What about the information on
that adventurer named Rudeus?

02:29.200 --> 02:32.460
Yeah, since he's famous,
it's easy to collect them.

02:32.460 --> 02:33.730
N-No way!

02:33.730 --> 02:38.250
Rudeus Greyrat, a Water Saint
Magician at the age of five.

02:38.250 --> 02:43.360
At the age of seven, he became a private
tutor of Eris Boreas Greyrat in Fittoa.

02:43.360 --> 02:46.140
He went missing after that.
But not long ago,

02:46.140 --> 02:49.370
he made a name for himself as an adventurer,
Rudeus the Quagmire.

02:49.370 --> 02:52.710
He's currently enrolled at
the University of Magic as a special student,

02:52.710 --> 02:54.250
and is reportedly staying
in the Magic City Sharia—

02:57.360 --> 03:01.840
Rudeus is not a prince
in her delusion?

03:03.370 --> 03:08.360
Even if his achievements are amazing,
he's just an adventurer.

03:08.360 --> 03:11.480
Defeating the red dragon by himself
must have been exaggerated.

03:11.480 --> 03:14.220
"Quagmire" is not that cool.

03:14.220 --> 03:16.720
I'm sure he's not that great either.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.100
Right!

03:20.270 --> 03:22.100
Just wait for me, Eris!

03:22.100 --> 03:23.820
I'm gonna defeat that Rudeus,

03:23.820 --> 03:26.780
make him my slave,
and parade him in front of you!

03:36.060 --> 03:39.920
Magicians are surprisingly
full of muscle, huh?

03:39.920 --> 03:42.340
Rudeus is over there, yes?

03:42.340 --> 03:43.590
Thank you!

03:43.590 --> 03:45.170
Rudeus?

03:48.870 --> 03:51.100
Are you going to challenge
Rudeus to duel as well?

03:51.100 --> 03:52.840
Y-Yes.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.580
I assume you're Rudeus the Quagmire.

03:59.580 --> 04:02.280
I request a duel of courtship with you.

04:07.440 --> 04:10.490
Uh, is this that sort of duel?

04:10.490 --> 04:11.450
The one of courtship

04:11.450 --> 04:13.060
- So that is Rudeus?
- that's been popular lately around this period?

04:13.060 --> 04:13.700
Indeed.

04:13.700 --> 04:16.470
- His body seems to be in good shape,
- I'm sorry, I may look like this,

04:16.470 --> 04:18.910
- but there's nothing imposing about him.
- but I'm not interested in men!

04:18.910 --> 04:20.570
- His face is not bad.
- but I'm not interested in men!

04:20.570 --> 04:22.600
- But he doesn't have a charm as a man.
- You don't have any right to refuse!

04:22.600 --> 04:23.530
- But he doesn't have a charm as a man.
- From the letter of Miss Pursena,

04:23.530 --> 04:25.960
- He really suits Eris.
- we have confirmed, you're the Boss of the pack.

04:25.960 --> 04:26.960
- Okay,
- Therefore,

04:26.960 --> 04:29.580
- I will defeat him, and...
- you have the obligation to accept duels.

04:30.040 --> 04:32.970
Let's fight fair and square!

04:34.920 --> 04:37.410
Well, it's settled.

04:39.050 --> 04:42.430
A magician defeated a warrior
in a close-range fight?

04:42.430 --> 04:45.950
No way, that beastfolk
must be really weak.

04:47.140 --> 04:50.960
You there. I'm looking for
a magician called Rudeus.

04:50.960 --> 04:54.260
Oh, you're going to
challenge him as well?

04:54.260 --> 04:55.280
Y-Yes.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.910
Then, go to the back of the line.

05:05.960 --> 05:09.470
What's with this line?
Is there a festival going on?

05:09.800 --> 05:13.540
This is a line of people who want
to challenge Rudeus to a duel!

05:13.540 --> 05:14.900
This many?

05:14.900 --> 05:18.360
Is there a way to challenge him first?

05:18.360 --> 05:21.600
Then, you have to defeat all of us!

05:21.600 --> 05:24.360
That's good! I like it!

05:24.360 --> 05:27.730
Well then, all of you,
come here and attack me!

05:27.730 --> 05:31.260
My name is Badigadi,
the Demon King of Immortality.

05:31.260 --> 05:35.110
If you win against me,
I'll bestow you the title of hero.

05:35.500 --> 05:37.070
Don't joke around, you bastard!

05:37.070 --> 05:38.950
I'll do it!

05:38.950 --> 05:39.840
W-What?!

05:39.840 --> 05:43.030
Don't get cocky, you bastard!

05:54.480 --> 05:56.470
Aww...

05:59.720 --> 06:01.640
Here I go.

06:01.640 --> 06:03.770
Yeah. Come at me!

06:17.660 --> 06:20.200
He defeated that Demon King
in a single blow?

06:20.660 --> 06:25.060
Eris is trying to stand beside him?

07:24.270 --> 07:27.100
Thank you for coming all this way.

07:27.100 --> 07:29.980
It must be hard to do long-distance
travel with those old bones of yours,

07:29.980 --> 07:31.360
Water God.

07:31.360 --> 07:33.280
Yes, it is.

07:33.280 --> 07:36.800
Still, you're begging me for a favor.

07:36.800 --> 07:39.490
I couldn't contain my curiosity
and came here.

07:40.090 --> 07:43.740
So, who will I be teaching?

07:45.960 --> 07:48.370
Excuse me.
I, Nina, have come.

07:55.800 --> 07:57.640
Be calm.

08:08.600 --> 08:09.850
Let me introduce them.

08:10.260 --> 08:14.820
This old lady's the Water God, Reida Lia.

08:14.820 --> 08:17.530
It's been a long time, Water God.

08:17.530 --> 08:21.540
Is that you, Nina?
You've gotten so big.

08:21.540 --> 08:23.900
Have you made it to Sword King already?

08:23.900 --> 08:26.500
No, I still have a long way to go.

08:26.850 --> 08:32.000
I may be the fastest,
but I'm not the strongest.

08:32.000 --> 08:35.630
Hey, sit down!
It's rude!

08:35.630 --> 08:42.090
Eris, this old lady's gonna teach you
all about the Water God Style.

08:43.080 --> 08:44.600
Nice to meet you.

08:45.090 --> 08:47.720
She's like a feral beast.

08:47.720 --> 08:50.180
I'm sorry, Gal-boy.

08:50.180 --> 08:53.480
But this girl's not fit for
the Water God Style.

08:53.480 --> 08:55.480
You think I didn't know that?

08:55.850 --> 08:58.400
What am I supposed to teach her, then?

08:58.400 --> 09:02.510
You don't have to teach her anything.
Just spar with her.

09:02.510 --> 09:04.060
Oh?

09:05.110 --> 09:09.960
Are you planning to have her
assassinate me, or what?

09:09.960 --> 09:11.600
Of course not.

09:11.600 --> 09:15.080
Why would I need to kill a granny
who's one foot in the grave already?

09:15.600 --> 09:21.040
Then, tell me.
Who are you planning to throw her at?

09:22.250 --> 09:26.930
This Eris here wants to defeat
Dragon God Orsted.

09:28.590 --> 09:32.180
What? The Dragon God?

09:33.690 --> 09:36.500
What a big ambition.

09:36.500 --> 09:38.230
You think she can do it?

09:38.780 --> 09:40.860
Yeah, I think she can do it.

09:40.860 --> 09:42.740
So does Eris.

09:43.220 --> 09:45.180
That's interesting.

09:45.180 --> 09:50.660
But I'm not interested in hanging out
with someone who doesn't have talent.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.920
Let's start with my disciple here.

09:52.920 --> 09:55.930
If she manages to overwhelm her,
I'll think about it.

09:58.200 --> 10:00.630
I've heard the situation.

10:01.320 --> 10:04.690
I am Water King Isolde Cluel.

10:04.690 --> 10:06.510
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

10:07.180 --> 10:10.620
Sword Saint Nina Farion.
Nice to meet you.

10:10.620 --> 10:12.320
Eris Greyrat.

10:14.540 --> 10:18.510
I'll play along since
my master asked me to.

10:18.510 --> 10:23.070
If you're only Saint,
this won't be much of a fight.

10:26.070 --> 10:29.440
Yes, I'm asking for your guidance.

11:15.540 --> 11:17.290
You can begin anytime.

11:30.720 --> 11:32.260
I won?

11:35.980 --> 11:38.620
Now, that's interesting.

11:38.620 --> 11:41.020
It's not interesting.

11:41.540 --> 11:45.030
Still, it seems to be a favorable start.

11:45.380 --> 11:47.000
What would you say?

11:47.000 --> 11:50.160
Do you want to learn
the Water God Style from me?

11:50.160 --> 11:54.200
No, I want to focus on mastering
the Sword God Style.

11:54.200 --> 11:57.520
I see, that's good.

11:57.520 --> 12:04.720
Then, how about we have three of them
train as a group for a while?

12:04.720 --> 12:06.840
Good idea.

12:06.840 --> 12:10.270
Okay, spend the morning with
your instructor as usual,

12:10.270 --> 12:13.100
and then three of you train together
when the sun starts to set.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.040
Yes, sir!

12:14.040 --> 12:16.060
Alright.

12:35.100 --> 12:37.730
It's my victory again.

12:37.730 --> 12:39.860
Isolde can beat Eris.

12:39.860 --> 12:41.660
While I can beat Isolde.

12:41.660 --> 12:43.490
And yet Eris beat me.

12:43.490 --> 12:45.170
There's no decisive outcome.

12:46.840 --> 12:49.300
Shall we have a debriefing?

12:49.300 --> 12:51.130
What's the use of that?

12:51.130 --> 12:55.690
In our Water God Style, we can grow
stronger by exchanging opinions.

12:57.050 --> 12:58.770
I'm fine with that, but...

13:01.180 --> 13:03.770
Okay, let's do that.

13:04.520 --> 13:06.900
That's decided then.
But first...

13:08.350 --> 13:09.260
Be louder!

13:09.260 --> 13:12.330
Let's move to a quieter place than here.

13:12.330 --> 13:14.320
I agree.

13:18.740 --> 13:21.080
Well then, I shall be direct.

13:21.080 --> 13:24.210
Eris, you radiate too much of your hostility.

13:24.210 --> 13:27.500
Water God Style practitioners
are sensitive to hostility.

13:27.500 --> 13:30.990
It tells us exactly when you're going to attack,
which makes it easy to react.

13:30.990 --> 13:34.780
Even if you say so,
what am I supposed to do about it?

13:34.780 --> 13:37.040
Let's see...

13:37.040 --> 13:39.970
Nina, you don't radiate hostility
before you attack.

13:39.970 --> 13:41.180
How do you do that?

13:41.180 --> 13:43.340
How?

13:43.340 --> 13:46.200
If you can move your sword faster
than your opponent,

13:46.200 --> 13:48.230
there's no need for hostility.

13:49.630 --> 13:51.110
I don't understand.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.200
Even so, why can't I ever beat you?

13:55.200 --> 13:56.760
It makes me lose confidence.

13:57.700 --> 14:01.560
It's because I'm making
you move after me.

14:01.560 --> 14:02.330
What?

14:02.900 --> 14:05.110
Ruijerd taught me this.

14:05.110 --> 14:11.170
You can use eye contact to make
people move first, or later.

14:11.170 --> 14:13.670
Ruijerd? Who's that?

14:13.670 --> 14:15.810
My teacher.

14:15.810 --> 14:21.460
In other words, you're deliberately
directing your opponent's actions?

14:21.460 --> 14:22.880
That's right.

14:24.580 --> 14:27.150
I see, and you've been using that
when facing me?

14:27.150 --> 14:30.060
Yeah, but you never move.

14:30.060 --> 14:33.200
That's how I was trained.

14:33.950 --> 14:37.780
Next time, perhaps you should focus on
suppressing your hostility instead.

14:38.990 --> 14:40.680
I'll give it a try.

14:41.400 --> 14:43.870
Hey, I wonder what I should try
to beat her.

14:43.870 --> 14:45.980
Good question.

14:45.980 --> 14:49.450
Why don't you ask your master?

14:49.450 --> 14:54.490
If I can do that, there's no need for
three of us to train together.

14:59.040 --> 15:01.870
There's no point in having
this debriefing, is there?

15:05.190 --> 15:05.970
Hey.

15:05.970 --> 15:06.920
What?

15:06.920 --> 15:09.960
How come you have the same
outfit as Ghislaine?

15:09.960 --> 15:12.370
Huh? Oh, that?

15:12.370 --> 15:15.250
We get that outfit created
when you become a Sword Saint.

15:15.250 --> 15:18.030
I don't really wear it often
since it's not to my liking.

15:18.030 --> 15:19.780
But I don't have one.

15:19.780 --> 15:21.990
If you want one,
why don't you go get it yourself?

15:21.990 --> 15:23.890
I'm sure you will be able to get it.

15:25.460 --> 15:26.920
What do you mean by that?

15:26.920 --> 15:30.740
As part of the Sword Saint exam,
we have to go hunt monsters.

15:30.740 --> 15:35.720
We make a coat out of their hide as
proof of becoming a Sword Saint.

15:35.720 --> 15:38.100
Where is that monster?

15:38.100 --> 15:41.890
It's in the forest with the waterfall to
the west of here, it's not that far.

15:42.230 --> 15:43.720
Show me the way!

15:46.140 --> 15:47.350
About that...

15:47.810 --> 15:50.310
Can I tag along with you?

16:07.900 --> 16:10.640
I think both of you will be fine.

16:10.640 --> 16:14.240
But still be careful, there are a lot
of them, and they're quite nimble.

16:14.240 --> 16:18.840
I don't have much experience hunting monsters,
so this makes me nervous.

16:18.840 --> 16:21.430
It's easier than dealing with
that beast over there.

16:21.430 --> 16:23.690
Hey, where's the monster?

16:23.690 --> 16:25.620
They will appear
when you light the fire.

16:25.620 --> 16:27.160
Just wait for a moment.

16:34.770 --> 16:36.410
This is strange.

16:36.410 --> 16:40.030
Let the great protection of fire
be on the place thou seekest.

16:40.030 --> 16:43.200
I call the bold heat of a torch
here and now.

16:43.200 --> 16:44.620
Fireball!

16:48.250 --> 16:50.710
You can use magic?!

16:50.710 --> 16:52.620
I learned it from Rudeus.

16:52.620 --> 16:54.850
He also taught me
how to write and read.

16:54.850 --> 16:57.130
He taught you magic and literacy?!

16:57.130 --> 16:58.840
And Ghislaine too.

16:58.840 --> 17:02.620
He also taught me Demon-God language
when we were in the Demon Continent.

17:02.620 --> 17:06.140
When we were in the Great Forest,
he could speak with the beastfolk.

17:06.140 --> 17:08.640
Rudeus is really amazing.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.310
You know...

17:21.569 --> 17:23.490
Those are the monsters.

17:35.090 --> 17:38.400
You're letting many of them
slip through!

18:15.320 --> 18:17.460
It was really fun.

18:17.900 --> 18:20.060
This is my first time training,

18:20.060 --> 18:23.320
exchanging opinions on
our performance,

18:23.320 --> 18:26.570
and hunting monsters with people whose
sword skills are on par with mine.

18:26.570 --> 18:28.430
Yes, me too.

18:33.390 --> 18:35.580
Then, I'll be on my way.

18:35.580 --> 18:37.860
Thank you for today.

18:37.860 --> 18:40.360
I'm glad we had that meeting.

18:40.360 --> 18:44.110
I can also feel myself getting
stronger day by day.

18:50.040 --> 18:53.180
And thank you as well, Eris.

18:53.180 --> 18:55.420
Next time, I'll land a hit on you.

18:55.970 --> 18:57.970
I'm looking forward to it.

18:57.970 --> 19:00.090
Well then, have a good rest.

19:09.510 --> 19:10.620
What?

19:10.620 --> 19:14.350
You want to know how to suppress
that hostility of yours, right?

19:14.800 --> 19:16.510
So what?

19:16.510 --> 19:21.460
From now on, take a bath,
wash your body, eat properly,

19:21.460 --> 19:26.860
and then sleep in a warm bed
while thinking about your man every day.

19:26.860 --> 19:30.240
What the heck is that?
Rudeus has nothing to do with this.

19:32.020 --> 19:35.980
Your hostility disappears
whenever you talk about him.

19:35.980 --> 19:37.250
You should give it a try.

19:41.160 --> 19:44.840
Besides, if you get too dirty,
he might hate you.

19:52.600 --> 19:58.180
It's true that Rudeus was diligent about
doing laundry and keeping things clean.

20:19.430 --> 20:20.290
Begin!

21:12.090 --> 21:16.160
All things considered,
they all seem evenly matched now.

21:16.160 --> 21:19.780
Even so, their power dynamic
hasn't changed.

21:19.780 --> 21:25.020
Still, the fact that they can each win one
out of every match is progress, I guess.

21:25.020 --> 21:27.850
Yes, they are improving.

21:27.850 --> 21:30.320
So this is what you were
aiming for, Master?

21:32.340 --> 21:33.030
Well,

21:33.030 --> 21:34.420
- it's true that they're getting stronger.
- You finally did it.

21:34.420 --> 21:36.050
- it's true that they're getting stronger.
- I thought I was going to die.

21:36.050 --> 21:37.910
It's hard to hold myself back.

21:37.910 --> 21:40.120
Next up is Nina and me, right?

21:40.120 --> 21:41.660
That's it for today.

21:41.660 --> 21:42.880
Why?

21:42.880 --> 21:46.870
We were supposed to have
a debriefing after this match.

21:46.870 --> 21:48.560
Oh, right!

21:49.710 --> 21:53.250
Make sure you take a bath
before debriefing!

21:57.200 --> 21:58.700
I know!

22:02.060 --> 22:05.060
EPISODE 02
HOWL, MAD DOG

23:35.070 --> 23:40.070
NEXT EPISODE
A RETURN TO NORMAL LIFE
